        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rWe&apos;ve got intel that the Washington&apos;s are trying to kill Arthur Edwars aka the Constant. They hired a terroristisc group in the name of the Great Britisch Revolution (GBR). Their core members are at this event. So if we want to strike this organisation, we better do it now. Finish of the GBR and protect Arthur Edwards at any costs. We can&apos;t lose our most important player in this game.\r\rGood luck 47",
